WEBVTT

00:09:59.444 --> 00:10:01.453
I don't hate children. I don't kick them.

00:10:01.477 --> 00:10:04.372
Yes, there was a little kid
wandering through this building

00:10:04.396 --> 00:10:06.820
when I came here, and no,
I didn't kick him.

00:10:06.844 --> 00:10:08.287
(Laughter)

00:10:08.311 --> 00:10:11.423
Course, I had to tell him
the building was for adults only,

00:10:11.447 --> 00:10:13.049
and to get out.

00:10:13.073 --> 00:10:14.969
He mumbled something about his mother,

00:10:14.993 --> 00:10:18.517
and I told him she'd probably
find him outside anyway.

00:10:18.541 --> 00:10:21.225
Last time I saw him,
he was on the stairs crying.

00:10:21.249 --> 00:10:22.337
(Laughter)

00:10:22.361 --> 00:10:23.518
What a wimp.

00:10:23.542 --> 00:10:24.549
(Laughter)

00:10:24.573 --> 00:10:27.165
But what do you mean?
That's what you expect me to say.

00:10:27.189 --> 00:10:29.166
Do you really think it's appropriate

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:35.803
that you should actually take
children and use them as a shield?